      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Connect four\n\nCore actions\nBoard of a certain size\ntwo pleayers\nselect a col and  the lowermost should be selected (gravity)\nGame ends when no more room\n4 in a row = win\n\nerrors\ncol full and user attempt\ninvalid col\nout of turn\n\nscope\nOne game or multiple ganes\nbackend or UI too\n\nfuture plans\nUNDO\nflexible board size",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Connect four\n\nCore actions\nBoard of a certain size\ntwo pleayers\nselect a col and  the lowermost should be selected (gravity)\nGame ends when no more room\n4 in a row = win\n\nerrors\ncol full and user attempt\ninvalid col\nout of turn\n\nscope\nOne game or multiple ganes\nbackend or UI too\n\nfuture plans\nUNDO\nflexible board size",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DFuHv2mPkVlvIpJVXdb4a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -123.53834620356099,
      "y": 553.2257567140981,
      "width": 902.939453125,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
