      "updated": 1788117068849,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Future Scope:\nExpandable board:\n    Board size and logic is seperate, because we only need to check 4\n    so min size 4 and max can be anything\n\nUndo:\n    Keep a stack in game, because game manages state\n    logic -> pop move from stack, clear board, change player, recompute gamestate if needed\n\nAdd computer bot\n    Make another class that calls the board's make move with first valid col\n    easy as we can simulate a player who only choses a col\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Future Scope:\nExpandable board:\n    Board size and logic is seperate, because we only need to check 4\n    so min size 4 and max can be anything\n\nUndo:\n    Keep a stack in game, because game manages state\n    logic -> pop move from stack, clear board, change player, recompute gamestate if needed\n\nAdd computer bot\n    Make another class that calls the board's make move with first valid col\n    easy as we can simulate a player who only choses a col\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
